                <div class="row">
                                                                                
                    <div id="content" class="layout-content col-12 col-lg-12 order-lg-1 order-0">
                          <div>
    
<div id="block-fawn-page-title">
  
    
      
  <h1><span class="field field-name-title">Dates &amp; Deadlines</span>
</h1>


  </div>
<div id="block-fawn-content" class="main-block">
  
    
      <article>

    
        

    
    <div class="node-content-wrapper " >
          <div class="layout layout--twocol-section layout--twocol-section--75-25">

          <div  class="layout__region layout__region--first">
        <div>
  
    
      
                        <div class="field field-name-body"><div class="tex2jax_process"><div class="content-grid row"><div class="col-12 col-md-4 content-grid-item"><div class="bg-light mb-2 pb-2 pt-4 px-4"><h3>On this page</h3><ul class="arrow-list"><li><a href="#deadlines">Deadlines for fall 2027 entry</a></li><li><a href="#otherapps">Other application dates</a></li><li><a href="#altadmission">Alternative admission deadlines</a></li><li><a href="#otherdates">Other dates</a></li><li><a href="#holidayschedule">University holiday schedule</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="col-12 col-md-8 content-grid-item"><div>
  
  
                        <div class="field field-name-field-media-image">  <img loading="lazy" src="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_crop/public/2022-12/banner_dates.png.webp?h=cfea4fea&amp;itok=itPDPdt5" width="1320" height="500" alt="Hazel McCallion Academic Learning Centre">


</div>
            
</div>
</div></div><hr><h2><a class="anchor" id="deadlines" name="deadlines"></a>Deadlines for fall 2027 entry</h2><table class="table styled-zebra"><thead><tr><th>Admission Category</th><th>Deadline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="top"><a href="/future-students/node/6">Chemical &amp; Physical Sciences</a><br><a href="/future-students/programs/undergraduate/commerce-management" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="fc42ef6b-8d6f-4e3e-86de-042abab6e7df" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Commerce &amp; Management">Commerce &amp; Management</a><br><a href="/future-students/node/18">Communication, Culture, Information &amp; Technology</a><br><a href="/future-students/programs/undergraduate/computer-science" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f40a11c3-7b83-450b-969f-f9355c8bfbe1" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Computer Science">Computer Science</a><br><a href="/future-students/node/20">Forensic Sciences</a><br><a href="/future-students/node/21">Humanities</a><br><a href="/future-students/node/22">Life Sciences</a><br><a href="/future-students/programs/undergraduate/mathematical-and-computational-sciences" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="8bc86e6a-4303-4ad4-84a3-67aa5a239fff" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Mathematical and Computational Sciences ">Mathematical &amp; Computational Sciences</a><br><a href="/future-students/node/24">Psychological &amp; Brain Sciences</a><br><a href="/future-students/node/25">Social Sciences</a><br><a href="/future-students/node/28">Theatre &amp; Drama Studies</a><br><a href="/future-students/node/29">Visual Studies</a></td><td class="top"><p><strong>January 15, 2027</strong></p><p><strong>November 7:</strong><br>Recommended application date for early consideration.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><a class="anchor" id="otherapps" name="otherapps"></a>Other application deadlines</h2><table class="table styled-zebra"><thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Deadline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="top"><a href="/future-students/admissions/document-submission" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="95c2a268-b487-45a9-a0aa-fd07e8fb0270" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Document Submission">Document Deadline</a></td><td class="top"><strong>February 1, 2027</strong><br>Review your deadline on the Join U of T website</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/future-students/admissions/supplementary-application" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="2c651728-3129-4711-8f40-e6fc6b3752c0" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Computer Science Supplementary Application">Computer Science Supplementary Application</a></td><td><strong>February 1, 2027</strong><br>Review your deadline on the Join U of T website</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/future-students/admissions/audition" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="dd4c4093-e605-4429-b51f-1af5b608f79c" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Theatre &amp; Drama Studies Audition">Theatre &amp; Drama Studies Audition</a></td><td><strong>Audition registration open in November 2026</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><a class="anchor" id="altadmission" name="altadmission"></a>Alternative admission deadlines</h2><table class="table styled-zebra"><thead><tr><th>Application</th><th>Summer Session</th><th>Fall Session</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/future-students/admissions/non-degree-visiting" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="ed8292d2-f3f3-4885-971b-bb45579ab24d" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Non-Degree &amp; Visiting Students">Non-Degree Studies</a></td><td><strong>See program deadlines above</strong></td><td><strong>See program deadlines above</strong></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/future-students/admissions/part-time" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="7590a517-b2c0-433f-b4aa-57e044d405ac" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Part-Time Students">Part-time Studies</a></td><td><strong>See program deadlines above</strong></td><td><strong>See program deadlines above</strong></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/future-students/bridging" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="ae826857-0f02-49c4-af34-83e3528cf78c" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="UTM Access &amp; Bridging Programs">Bridging Pathway</a><br><a href="/future-students/admissions/refugee-pathway" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="5d66bd64-67c4-4736-96a0-78b6cd1f25d6" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Refugee Pathway">Refugee Pathway</a></td><td>Applications open in early March 2027</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/future-students/admissions/non-degree-visiting" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="ed8292d2-f3f3-4885-971b-bb45579ab24d" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Non-Degree &amp; Visiting Students">Visiting Student</a><br><a href="/future-students/admissions/senior-citizen-student" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="515d16d8-2c77-4eac-8046-26d65621b852" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Non-Degree Senior Citizen Student">Non-Degree Senior Citizen Student</a></td><td colspan="2"><p><strong>April 15</strong><br>for courses that begin in May</p><p><strong>June 15</strong><br>for courses that begin in July</p><p><strong>August 1</strong><br>for courses that begin in September</p><p><strong>December 1</strong><br>for courses that begin in January</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><a class="anchor" id="when-decisions-are-made" name="when-decisions-are-made"></a><hr><h2><a class="anchor" id="otherdates" name="otherdates"></a>Other dates</h2><table class="table styled-zebra"><tbody><tr><td><span><strong>September</strong></span></td><td><ul><li>(Mid September) The online application will be available on the&nbsp;<a href="http://www.ouac.on.ca/">Ontario Universities' Application Centre website</a>. Check with your school/guidance counsellor for details and assistance.</li><li>September 26-27: The <a href="https://www.ontariouniversitiesevents.ca/ouf/">Ontario Universities' Fair</a> takes place.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>October</strong></td><td><ul><li>(Mid October) Access to the <a href="https://join.utoronto.ca/">Join U of T website</a> opens for applicants.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>November</strong></td><td><ul><li>November 7: Recommended application deadline for early consideration.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>December</strong></td><td><ul><li>(Early December): Document deadline for early consideration. This includes academic reports and transcripts to date, supplementals, and English proficiency test results.&nbsp;</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>February</strong></td><td><ul><li>(Varies by year) Deadline to submit an application for the Awards Profile on <a href="http://join.utoronto.ca/">Join U of T</a> to be considered for U of T scholarships and awards.</li><li>(Varies by year) The first round of admission offers are made to OUAC applicants currently in high school. Keep in mind that only a small percentage of students will receive their offer during this phase.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>March</strong></td><td><ul><li>March 1: Deadline for deferred incoming students to confirm return to U of T.</li><li>March 31: Deadline to qualify for the residence guarantee.&nbsp;Complete Step 1 of&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href="https://starportal.utoronto.ca/">StarRez Application</a>&nbsp;soon because after this date, residence may not be guaranteed.</li><li>(Varies by year) Monthly round of admission offers are made to OUAC applicants currently in high school.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>April</strong></td><td><ul><li>(Varies by year) Monthly round of admission offers are made to OUAC applicants currently in high school.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>May</strong></td><td><ul><li>May 1: For Canadian and International applicants, the date by which you must select a university may be as early as May 1; review your offer letter for your specific date</li><li>(Late May) The final round of admission offers are made to OUAC applicants currently in high school.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>June</strong></td><td><ul><li>June 1: For Ontario high school applicants, the last date by which you must select a university offer to accept on OUAC. Review your offer letter for your specific date.</li><li>(Throughout June) We continue to make offers to qualified students on a rolling basis as space remains in programs.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>July</strong></td><td><ul><li>(Early July) Deferral request form becomes available on <a href="http://join.utoronto.ca/">Join U of T</a> for admitted students wanting to defer their offer to next academic year.</li><li>(Throughout July) We continue to make offers to qualified students on a rolling basis as space remains in programs.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>August</strong></td><td><ul><li>(Throughout August) We continue to make offers to qualified students on a rolling basis as space remains in programs.</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2><a class="anchor" id="holidayschedule" name="holidayschedule"></a>University holiday schedule</h2><p>The University is closed on dates cited below. The library, athletic facilities, and student centres may offer reduced hours during some holidays. Check their respective websites for closure times.</p><table class="table styled-zebra"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Presidential Days</strong></td><td><span>Monday, June 29, 2026</span><br><span>Tuesday, June 30, 2026</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Canada Day</strong></td><td><span>Wednesday, July 1, 2026</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Civic Holiday</strong></td><td>Monday, August 3, 2026</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Labour Day</strong></td><td>Monday, September 7, 2026</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thanksgiving Day</strong></td><td>Monday, October 12, 2026</td></tr><tr><td><strong>December Holiday Break </strong><span><strong>(including Presidential Day)&nbsp;</strong></span></td><td>Thursday, December 24, 2026, to<br>Tuesday, January 5, 2027</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Family Day</strong></td><td>Monday, February 15, 2027</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Good Friday</strong></td><td>Friday, March 26, 2027</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Victoria Day</strong></td><td>Monday, May 24, 2027</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
            
  </div>
<div>
  
    
      
