                <div class="footer--statement py-5 my-6" role="region" aria-label="Statement of Land Acknowledgement">
                    <p class="mb-0">We wish to acknowledge this land on which the University of Toronto operates. For thousands of years it has been the traditional land of the Wendat Nation, the Seneca, and the Mississaugas of the Credit. Today, this meeting place is still the home to many Indigenous people from across Turtle Island and we are grateful to have the opportunity to work on this land. <br />
